 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting': Coruscant: Jedi Council Chamber, Boonta Eve Podrace, Anakin's Podracer, Tatooine: Podrace Arena, Security Control and Podrace Prep; these count toward the 60.",
  "The author calls this his 'Ls Type II' deck (Episode I-only environment); format left as set — Bill to decide. The Coruscant-set printings are used for Coruscant: Docking Bay, Alter and Sense.",
  "The post's tag says Dark, but the strategy says 'Ls Type II' and every card is Light; side is Light.",
  "Posted 'Yoda' dested Yoda, Senior Council Member (Coruscant): the Dagobah Yoda is not an Episode I card, so not legal in Type II.",
  "Posted 'Queen Amidala' x2 dested Queen Amidala, Ruler Of Naboo (Coruscant): the card titled Queen Amidala is Theed Palace (December 2001), released after this post.",
  "Posted 'Qui Gons Saber' dested Qui-Gon Jinn's Lightsaber (Tatooine; Qui-Gon's Lightsaber is Reflections III, released after this post); 'Chancellor Valorum' dested Supreme Chancellor Valorum; 'Liana Meria' dested Liana Merian; 'Obi-Wan Padawan Learner' dested Obi-Wan Kenobi, Padawan Learner.",
  "The 'Epic Events' header line was removed. Total is 60 as published."
